3437
02:30:39.810 --> 02:30:41.870
some of the dance companies anyway, that come through.

3438
02:30:41.870 --> 02:30:43.260
So he's still has that connection,

3439
02:30:43.260 --> 02:30:44.870
but my parents were very involved

3440
02:30:44.870 --> 02:30:46.540
in the dance world growing up,

3441
02:30:46.540 --> 02:30:48.290
the basement was just a big mirror,

3442
02:30:49.890 --> 02:30:50.900
where they would use to...

3443
