3454
02:31:17.960 --> 02:31:20.090
perhaps than I do. Yeah.

3455
02:31:20.090 --> 02:31:21.720
That's wild. Yeah.

3456
02:31:21.720 --> 02:31:22.553
They did that and...

3457
02:31:22.553 --> 02:31:24.150
